      ],
      "content": "MARLOWES 1.  5252                                                   No 81 TL 0507 1/200 II                       GV 2. Early C19.  Stucco, hipped Welsh slated roof with eaves cornice.  2 storeys, 3 sash windows in architrave surrounds to 1st floor, 2 ground floor canted bay windows with wooden balustrades to flat roofs.  Central doorway had until recently an excellent arched trellis porch, now removed.  Included for group value. Nos 75 to 85 (odd) form a group. Listing NGR: TL0557207194"
